{"id":"torrey:moabites","source":"torrey","name":"Moabites","slug":"moabites","seeAlso":[],"entries":[{"text":"Descended from Lot — Ge 19:37.","refs":[["Gen",19,37,19,37]]},{"text":"Children of Lot. — De 2:9.","refs":[["Deut",2,9,2,9]]},{"text":"People of Chemosh. — Nu 21:29; Jer 48:46.","refs":[["Num",21,29,21,29],["Jer",48,46,48,46]]},{"text":"Are given to, as a possession — De 2:9.","refs":[["Deut",2,9,2,9]]},{"text":"Separated from the Amorites by the river Arnon — Nu 21:13.","refs":[["Num",21,13,21,13]]},{"text":"Expelled the ancient Emims — De 2:9-11.","refs":[["Deut",2,9,2,11]]},{"text":"Possessed many and great cities — Nu 21:28,30; Isa 15:1-4; Jer 48:21-24.","refs":[["Num",21,28,21,28],["Num",21,30,21,30],["Isa",15,1,15,4],["Jer",48,21,48,24]]},{"text":"Governed by kings — Nu 23:7; Jos 24:9.","refs":[["Num",23,7,23,7],["Josh",24,9,24,9]]},{"text":"Proud and arrogant. — Isa 16:6; Jer 48:29.","refs":[["Isa",16,6,16,6],["Jer",48,29,48,29]]},{"text":"Idolatrous. — 1Ki 11:7.","refs":[["1Kgs",11,7,11,7]]},{"text":"Superstitious. — Jer 27:3,9.","refs":[["Jer",27,3,27,3],["Jer",27,9,27,9]]},{"text":"Rich and confident. — Jer 48:7.","refs":[["Jer",48,7,48,7]]},{"text":"Prosperous and at ease. — Jer 48:11.","refs":[["Jer",48,11,48,11]]},{"text":"Mighty men of war. — Jer 48:14.","refs":[["Jer",48,14,48,14]]},{"text":"Deprived of a large part of their territories by the Amorites — Nu 21:26.","refs":[["Num",21,26,21,26]]},{"text":"Refused to let Israel pass — Jdj 11:17,18.","refs":[["Judg",11,17,11,17],["Judg",11,18,11,18]]},{"text":"Alarmed at the number, &c of Israel — Nu 22:3.","refs":[["Num",22,3,22,3]]},{"text":"With Midian send for Balaam to curse Israel — Nu 22:1-24:25.","refs":[["Num",22,1,24,25]]},{"text":"Enticed to idolatry by. — Nu 25:1-3.","refs":[["Num",25,1,25,3]]},{"text":"Forbidden to spoil. — De 2:9; Jdj 11:15.","refs":[["Deut",2,9,2,9],["Judg",11,15,11,15]]},{"text":"Forbidden to make leagues with. — De 23:6.","refs":[["Deut",23,6,23,6]]},{"text":"Sometimes intermarried with. — Ru 1:4; 1Ki 11:1; 1Ch 8:8; Ne 13:23.","refs":[["Ruth",1,4,1,4],["1Kgs",11,1,11,1],["1Chr",8,8,8,8],["Neh",13,23,13,23]]},{"text":"Excluded from the congregation of Israel forever — De 23:3,4; Ne 13:1,2.","refs":[["Deut",23,3,23,3],["Deut",23,4,23,4],["Neh",13,1,13,1],["Neh",13,2,13,2]]},{"text":"Always hostile to Israel — Ps 83:6; Eze 25:8.","refs":[["Ps",83,6,83,6],["Ezek",25,8,25,8]]},{"text":"Harassed and subdued by Saul — 1Sa 14:47.","refs":[["1Sam",14,47,14,47]]},{"text":"Gave an asylum to David’s family — 1Sa 22:4.","refs":[["1Sam",22,4,22,4]]},{"text":"Made tributary to David — 2Sa 8:2,12.","refs":[["2Sam",8,2,8,2],["2Sam",8,12,8,12]]},{"text":"Benaiah slew two champions of — 2Sa 23:20.","refs":[["2Sam",23,20,23,20]]},{"text":"Paid tribute of sheep and wool to the king of Israel — 2Ki 3:4; Isa 16:1.","refs":[["2Kgs",3,4,3,4],["Isa",16,1,16,1]]},{"text":"Revolted from Israel after the death of Ahab — 2Ki 1:1; 3:5.","refs":[["2Kgs",1,1,1,1],["2Kgs",3,5,3,5]]},{"text":"Israel and Judah joined against — 2Ki 3:6,7.","refs":[["2Kgs",3,6,3,6],["2Kgs",3,7,3,7]]},{"text":"Miraculously deceived by the colour of the water — 2Ki 3:21-24.","refs":[["2Kgs",3,21,3,24]]},{"text":"Conquered by Israel and Judah — 2Ki 3:24-26.","refs":[["2Kgs",3,24,3,26]]},{"text":"King of, sacrificed his son to excite animosity against Israel — 2Ki 3:27.","refs":[["2Kgs",3,27,3,27]]},{"text":"Joined Babylon against Judah — 2Ki 24:2.","refs":[["2Kgs",24,2,24,2]]},{"text":"Terror on account of Israel. — Ex 15:15.","refs":[["Exod",15,15,15,15]]},{"text":"Desolation and grief. — Isa 15:1-9; 16:2-11.","refs":[["Isa",15,1,15,9],["Isa",16,2,16,11]]},{"text":"Inability to avert destruction. — Isa 16:12.","refs":[["Isa",16,12,16,12]]},{"text":"To destroyed in three years. — Isa 16:13,14.","refs":[["Isa",16,13,16,13],["Isa",16,14,16,14]]},{"text":"To be captives in Babylon. — Jer 27:3,8; 48:7.","refs":[["Jer",27,3,27,3],["Jer",27,8,27,8],["Jer",48,7,48,7]]},{"text":"Their desolation as a punishment for their hatred of Israel. — Jer 48:26,27; Eze 25:8,9.","refs":[["Jer",48,26,48,26],["Jer",48,27,48,27],["Ezek",25,8,25,8],["Ezek",25,9,25,9]]},{"text":"Restoration from captivity. — Jer 48:47.","refs":[["Jer",48,47,48,47]]},{"text":"Subjugation to Messiah. — Nu 24:17; Isa 25:10.","refs":[["Num",24,17,24,17],["Isa",25,10,25,10]]},{"text":"Subjugation to Israel. — Isa 11:14.","refs":[["Isa",11,14,11,14]]}],"refCount":72}
